catalogue.json: every Govee model's scene catalogue (codes, names, groups, parameter data, deduplicated) as Govee publishes
it per SKU and Beshelmek/govee_ble_lights mirrors it in custom_components/govee-ble-lights/jsons/<SKU>.json, commit
fc13097ef54c7b4a77f044659c138965e8b2d91a (MIT licence, (c) 2021 Vladimir Votyakov). Made by extract-catalogue.ts from
those files; SYNQ reads it at build time only (scripts/gen-govee-scenes.ts); nothing is fetched at run time.

models.json: SYNQ's own table of the models it drives and how each takes colour (see its "about").
